{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform Anomaly </strong>\u2014 is a cooperative horror game designed to play with friends. Dark places, strange phenomena, and tension that can at any moment turn into laughter await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo version includes a limited set of anomalies, mechanics, and maps. The core gameplay systems are available, providing everything you need for a full experience in the demo. The full version will include much more content, new mechanics, and significantly longer playtime.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/bcc356b48c8254b3610185ee468c140f.poster.avif?t=1759826687\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/bcc356b48c8254b3610185ee468c140f.webm?t=1759826687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/bcc356b48c8254b3610185ee468c140f.mp4?t=1759826687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers several modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard </strong>\u2014 cooperate with your team and explore the surroundings to find and mark dangerous anomalies. Be careful: nothing here is as simple as it seems, and the slightest mistake can cost you the round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek </strong>\u2014 one player becomes the \u201chider\u201d, places anomalies on the map, and watches as others try to find them. Everything here depends on your cunning and ingenuity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/070972743459984b79ff02aea8a55d6a.poster.avif?t=1759826687\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/070972743459984b79ff02aea8a55d6a.webm?t=1759826687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to search for and mark anomalies: strange areas of the map with distorted geometry or textures, unusual sounds, and abnormal object behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/3ab642eab13a74100d45fb5796d31b8b.poster.avif?t=1759826687\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/3ab642eab13a74100d45fb5796d31b8b.webm?t=1759826687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> If players correctly mark all anomalies, they will be able to move to the next station alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/2731ea486e868a4bb03094dd8175b8d1.poster.avif?t=1759826687\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/2731ea486e868a4bb03094dd8175b8d1.webm?t=1759826687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Search for anomalies with your friends \u2014 or hide them yourself and watch their attempts to find them,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>it\u2019s a cooperative horror game where fear easily turns into laughter.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/64919ff4db47def47dc55744d66f5c84.poster.avif?t=1759826687\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/64919ff4db47def47dc55744d66f5c84.webm?t=1759826687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019310/extras/64919ff4db47def47dc55744d66f5c84.mp4?t=1759826687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4019310/fcd6a673321e16e8e65ca069bf8928f248905304.jpg"},{"name":"The Exit Is Real","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4019310/db96a6ececb1bba3d9a0dd99d7ada01fa2bc7ed4.jpg"},{"name":"Something\u2019s Off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4019310/b09995a9fc0821a86cb7651f0354dcd6b49bd3e1.jpg"},{"name":"First Contact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4019310/4903bd00b656fcce91bcc612640c5a4383c38df1.jpg"},{"name":"Not Alone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4019310/60d8a3a08a3df244ad1a329ed171c2e59b9885ea.jpg"},{"name":"Under the Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4019310/117dd835eb296d06ad4482a4bb975927850cab2f.jpg"},{"name":"???","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4019310/9badc9b93d8e7733f53e5b291317e35a3a0ddcd1.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images